        <item>
            <title>Version 1.6.31</title>
            <sparkle:version>1.6.31</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.6.31</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <description><![CDATA[Fixed a bug where Sparkle's own update dialog could get silently closed if you reopened the main Reprise window while an update was sitting at Ready to Install — discarding an already-downloaded update with no warning. Also: the Upcoming tab label no longer wraps onto two lines when its notification badge appears.]]></description>
